3 Environment Configuration ('go-flow-api.env')
***********************************************

Default file locations by platform:

   * Linux: '/etc/go-flow-api/go-flow-api.env'
   * FreeBSD: '/usr/local/etc/go-flow-api/go-flow-api.env'
   * macOS: '/opt/flow-api/etc/go-flow-api.env'
   * Windows: 'C:\ProgramData\ETL Madness\Flow API\go-flow-api.env'

Key environment variables include 'FLOW_API_DSN', 'FLOW_API_ADDR',
'FLOW_SECURE_KEY', 'FLOW_API_LOG_FILE', 'FLOW_API_DEBUG', and Active
Directory / Kerberos variables ('AD_REALM', 'KRB5_CONFIG',
'KRB5_KTNAME', 'KRB5CCNAME').


