5 REST API Overview
*******************

   * 'GET /api/v1/health': Public health, database driver, and schema check.
   * 'GET /swagger/' & 'GET /api/v1/openapi.json': Swagger UI & OpenAPI 3.0.3.
   * '/api/v1/artifacts/{type}' & '/api/v1/upload/{type}': CRUD, ID lookup,
     XML export, and file upload for 'pipelines', 'options', and 'configs'.
   * 'POST /api/v1/execute', 'POST /api/v1/execute/stream',
     'POST /api/v1/validate': Synchronous execution, live SSE node
     streaming, and XSD/AST validation.
   * 'GET /api/v1/runs', 'GET /api/v1/events', 'GET /api/v1/audit':
     Execution history, 'node_output' telemetry, and API audit trail.
   * '/api/v1/users' & 'POST /api/v1/db/test': Administrative BasicAuth
     user management and DSN connectivity verification.


